    "description": "This item is eligible for shipping, but due to its size, weight, or fragile nature, delivery costs may significantly exceed the item's actual value. Please review the specific Shipping Instructions below for full details.\\n\\nRefer to pictures for more details, overall size and condition. Tape measurements are shown in the pictures.\\nPhoto of similar Google search included.\\n\\nUS State Quarter Collection Lot  50 State Albums, Gold & Platinum Plated Sets with COA\\n\\nItem Description\\n\\nUp for auction is a comprehensive multi-set lot dedicated to the United States 50 State Quarters Program. This collection features a mix of standard archival albums, uncirculated mint sets, and premium plated novelty editions perfect for both beginner and seasoned numismatists.\\n\\nWhat’s Included in This Lot:\\n\\nFifty States Quarter Collection Album & Folders: Includes the official black presentation folder with map graphic and multi-page black slot inserts, plus a secondary tri-fold cardboard collector folder containing a substantial start on the 50-state series.\\n\\n2001 Platinum Edition State Quarter Collection: A premium 5-coin year set featuring uncirculated 2001 state quarters highlighted with a genuine platinum plating. Comes in its original patriotic display box.\\n\\n2001 Gold Edition State Quarter Collection: A matching 5-coin year set featuring uncirculated 2001 state quarters layered in 24K gold plating. Retains its original patriotic theme box.\\n\\n2000 Philadelphia Mint Edition State Quarter Collection: A 5-coin uncirculated year set showcasing the quarters struck at the historic Philadelphia Mint for the year 2000.\\n\\n\nUncirculated Coin Display Set with Certificate of Authenticity: An open display presentation folder featuring a 5-coin uncirculated strip accompanied by its original official paper Certificate of Authenticity (COA).",
